      $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $   $
    # Bucket Brigade | A campfire guards the pen: fetch water from the well. Wildfire is eating the wood you need.
    - |
