Version: "0.1"
Environment:
  Name: Deep Delve
  Description: |
    An isometric mine. Dig through dirt and rock (`dig`, two hits for rock), mine ore veins and fill
    every ore cart (3 ore each), then ride the lift out. Digging costs stamina (rations
    restore it). The mine slopes south: undermined boulders wobble, then roll and crush you. Lava
    oozes into dug tunnels. Timber support beams (`build`) stop both.
    Generated by studio/griddly-demo/tools/remaster â€” edit the generator, not this file.
  # Cameras are observers. The demo picks one by name and the engine renders it.
  #   Isometric  whole level, isometric (the main view of this game)
  #   IsoFollow  11x11 isometric window that follows the avatar
  #   Sprite2D   whole level, top-down
  #   FollowCam  15x11 top-down window that follows the avatar
  #   CloseUp    9x9 top-down window that follows the avatar (also the agent's default view)
  Observers:
    Isometric:
      TileSize: [32, 48]
      IsoTileHeight: 16
      IsoTileDepth: 4
      BackgroundTile: remastered/minecrawler-cave-iso.png
    IsoFollow:
      Type: ISOMETRIC
      TileSize: [32, 48]
      IsoTileHeight: 16
      IsoTileDepth: 4
      BackgroundTile: remastered/minecrawler-cave-iso.png
      TrackAvatar: true
      RotateWithAvatar: false
      Width: 11
      Height: 11
    Sprite2D:
      TileSize: 24
      BackgroundTile: oryx/oryx_fantasy/floor1-0.png
      RotateAvatarImage: false
      TrackAvatar: false
    FollowCam:
      Type: SPRITE_2D
      TileSize: 24
      BackgroundTile: oryx/oryx_fantasy/floor1-0.png
      RotateAvatarImage: false
      RotateWithAvatar: false
      TrackAvatar: true
      Width: 15
      Height: 11
    CloseUp:
      Type: SPRITE_2D
      TileSize: 24
      BackgroundTile: oryx/oryx_fantasy/floor1-0.png
      RotateAvatarImage: false
      RotateWithAvatar: false
      TrackAvatar: true
      Width: 9
      Height: 9
    Block2D:
      TileSize: 24
  Variables:
    - Name: carts_needed
      InitialValue: 0
  Player:
    Observer:
      TrackAvatar: true
      RotateWithAvatar: false
      RotateAvatarImage: false
      Width: 9
      Height: 9
    AvatarObject: miner
  Termination:
    Win:
      - eq: [lift:count, 0]
    Lose:
      - eq: [miner:count, 0]
  Levels:
    # Shallow Seam | Dig through the rock seam, fill one ore cart, ride the lift.
    - |
      W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W
      W   d   d   d   d   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   v   d   d   d   d   v   v   d   W
      W   d   d   d   d   |   r   d   d   d   W   W   W   v   d   O   d   d   d   d   d   W
      W   d   d   :   :   o   .   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   v   d   d   O   d   d   d   W
      W   d   .   :/A .   *   .   r   r   d   W   W   W   d   v   d   d   d   d   d   d   W
      W   d   t   .   .   .   .   r   r   d   W   W   W   d   d   r   r   r   d   d   d   W
      W   d   d   d   o   d   O   r   r   d   W   W   W   d   d   r   r   d   r   r   d   W
      W   d   d   d   d   d   d   r   r   n   d   r   d   n   d   |   .   d   r   d   d   W
      W   d   d   O   d   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   .   .   .   +   d   O   d   W
      W   d   d   d   d   v   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   r   .   .   :   .   .   d   d   W
      W   v   d   d   d   v   d   d   d   O   W   W   W   r   +   :   :   ^   E   d   r   W
      W   d   d   d   d   d   r   d   d   d   W   W   W   r   d   :   c   .   d   r   r   W
      W   d   d   d   d   d   r   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   d   d   d   d   d   W
      W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W
    # Boulder Gallery | A boulder hangs over the gate: dig, then brace it with a beam!
    - |
      W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W
      W   d   d   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   r   d   d   W   W   W   d   O   O   d   v   W
      W   d   t   ^   ^   |   r   r   W   W   W   d   d   d   r   d   d   W   W   W   d   r   d   d   d   W
      W   d   +   :/A +   :   .   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   O   r   d   d   d   W
      W   d   d   .   o   :   d   d   W   W   W   O   d   d   d   d   O   W   W   W   d   r   d   d   d   W
      W   O   d   d   d   d   d   d   W   O   W   d   d   d   r   r   O   W   W   W   d   d   d   d   d   W
      W   d   d   d   d   d   d   n   d   d   d   n   d   d   r   r   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   O   d   W
      W   d   d   d   O   O   d   d   W   W   W   r   :   +   |   r   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   v   v   W
      W   d   d   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   :   :   :   :   :   v   W   W   W   d   d   d   v   v   W
      W   d   O   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   f   o   .   d   v   W   W   W   d   d   d   d   d   W
      W   d   d   v   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   d   d   n   d   r   d   n   d   r   r   d   W
      W   d   d   v   O   d   d   r   W   W   W   v   v   O   d   d   d   W   W   W   r   |   .   c   d   W
      W   d   d   r   r   d   d   r   W   W   W   d   v   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   .   .   .   .   W
      W   v   d   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   O   d   d   d   r   d   W   W   W   d   .   .   E   d   W
      W   r   r   d   d   r   r   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   r   r   d   W   W   W   d   c   d   d   d   W
      W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W
    # Magma Pockets | Lava oozes into any tunnel dug next to it. Beams hold it back.
    - |
      W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W
      W   d   d   d   d   d   d   O   W   W   W   d   d   d   r   d   d   W   W   W   d   r   r   d   d   W
      W   d   d   d   d   d   v   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   r   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   r   d   d   W
